  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 801.14 Notice to New Billing Units or New Customers for CWS and NCWS",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 801.14 Notice to New Billing Units or New Customers for CWS and NCWS.\n\n(a) A CWS O/O shall give to each new billing unit or new hookup, prior to or at the time service begins, a copy of the most recent public notice for any of the following:\n\n(1) Any outstanding violation;\n\n(2) The existence of any exemption; or\n\n(3) Any other ongoing situation for which public notice is required.\n\n(b) An NCWS O/O shall continuously post the public notice for any of the violations or situations identified in (a)(1) through (3), above, for as long as the violation, exemption, or other situation persists or 7 days, whichever is longer.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw800.html"
